{"story":{"id":"event-ancrel-4008","title":{"zh":"石中低语","en":"Whispers in the Stone"},"category":"precursors","kind":"event","image":"art/f7bcd1747cbd11842197.webp","start":"ancrel.4000","chapters":7,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"和以往相比，我们最近在采掘技术方面的进步使得我们能更加深入[Root.GetName]的地壳部分。而在巨大的矿井深处，我们碰巧发现了一个古老外星文明留下的痕迹，它一直延伸到山脉中。这个文明似乎是沿着这些未被开发的矿脉所建立，发掘这个遗址将阻碍我们在这颗星球上的采矿作业，并无法再从新矿脉中提取矿石，但这也将带给我们新的科学发现。","en":"Our recent advancements in mining technology have enabled us to bore deeper into [Root.GetName]'s crust than ever before. In the depths of its cavernous mineral mines, we have stumbled upon traces of an ancient alien civilization leading further into the mount"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"ancrel.4000","parent":"n0","via":{"chance":0.05,"group":"r106","delay":[{"days":"30","random":"90"}],"hooks":["immediate"],"kind":"entry","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt:3419","sets":["discovered_lithoids_arc_site"],"triggers":[{"zh":"完成研究时","en":"When a technology is researched"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:lithoids_digsite","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"ancrel.4000.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt:3441"},"children":["n3","n4","n5","n6","n7"]},"n3":{"doc":"ancrel.4001","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:2106"},"children":[]},"n4":{"doc":"ancrel.4002","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:2111"},"children":[]},"n5":{"doc":"ancrel.4003","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:2116"},"children":[]},"n6":{"doc":"ancrel.4004","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:2121"},"children":[]},"n7":{"doc":"ancrel.4005","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:2126"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"ancrel.4000","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"石中低语","en":"Whispers in the Stone"},"texts":[{"zh":"和以往相比，我们最近在采掘技术方面的进步使得我们能更加深入[Root.GetName]的地壳部分。而在巨大的矿井深处，我们碰巧发现了一个古老外星文明留下的痕迹，它一直延伸到山脉中。这个文明似乎是沿着这些未被开发的矿脉所建立，发掘这个遗址将阻碍我们在这颗星球上的采矿作业，并无法再从新矿脉中提取矿石，但这也将带给我们新的科学发现。","en":"Our recent advancements in mining technology have enabled us to bore deeper into [Root.GetName]'s crust than ever before. In the depths of its cavernous mineral mines, we have stumbled upon traces of an ancient alien civilization leading further into the mountain. The civilization seems to have been built along an unexploited ore vein. Excavating the site will impede our mining operations on the planet and would make abstraction from the new vein impossible but could lead to new scientific discovery."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/f7bcd1747cbd11842197.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"ancrel.4000.a","label":{"zh":"有趣，开始发掘！","en":"Intriguing. Start digging!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"archaeological_site_types:lithoids_digsite","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt:3441","story":"event-ancrel-4008"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"ancrel.4000.b","label":{"zh":"我们的矿物生产不能被搁置！","en":"Our mineral production cannot be halted."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","line":3429}},{"id":"archaeological_site_types:lithoids_digsite","kind":"site","title":{"zh":"石中低语","en":"Whispers in the Stone"},"texts":[{"zh":"在[From.Planet.GetName]上的矿井的深处，是一处古老外星文明所遗留的痕迹。宏伟的装饰建筑和洞室告诉我们，一个有着丰富文化的文明已经能够巧妙地切割基岩和建设隧道系统，它们被厚实的闸门所保护，通往更加深入的山体之中。\n\n由于山体中富集的，以爆炸性闻名的甲烷气体，继续探索下去会很危险。","en":"In the depths of [From.Planet.GetName]'s mines are traces of an ancient alien civilization. Magnificent ornamental structures and cavernous chambers telling of a rich culture have been cut expertly from the bedrock and a system of paved tunnels, protected by massive gates, leads deeper into the mountain.\n\nExploring the site will be perilous as the mountain is rich with methane gas, known for its explosive qualities."}],"sections":[{"zh":"在[From.Planet.GetName]上的矿井的深处，是一处古老外星文明所遗留的痕迹。宏伟的装饰建筑和洞室告诉我们，一个有着丰富文化的文明已经能够巧妙地切割基岩和建设隧道系统，它们被厚实的闸门所保护，通往更加深入的山体之中。\n\n由于山体中富集的，以爆炸性闻名的甲烷气体，继续探索下去会很危险。","en":"In the depths of [From.Planet.GetName]'s mines are traces of an ancient alien civilization. Magnificent ornamental structures and cavernous chambers telling of a rich culture have been cut expertly from the bedrock and a system of paved tunnels, protected by massive gates, leads deeper into the mountain.\n\nExploring the site will be perilous as the mountain is rich with methane gas, known for its explosive qualities."}],"image":"art/64f29c07314834259f66.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.4001","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:2106","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"event-ancrel-4008"},{"target":"ancrel.4002","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:2111","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"event-ancrel-4008"},{"target":"ancrel.4003","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:2116","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"event-ancrel-4008"},{"target":"ancrel.4004","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:2121","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"event-ancrel-4008"},{"target":"ancrel.4005","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:2126","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"event-ancrel-4008"},{"target":"ancrel.8000","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r29718","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8001","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29718","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:3","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8002","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29718","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:4","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8003","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29718","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:5","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8010","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r29718","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8011","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29718","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:3","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"a